          "type": "response_end",
          "response": {
            "text": "Alberto has built three AI agents, plus one more in progress:\n\n- **Fraud Detection Agent** (offline evals, ready for deployment): reviews newly published events and organizers on an online ticketing platform and recommends approve, reject, or request info, with reasons, for a human admin. In offline evals (31 cases), it approved fraud 0% of the time without human review, and the chosen model, Claude Haiku 5.5, reached 86% accuracy at about $0.002 per review.\n- **Organizer Support Agent** (coming soon, not built yet): would answer organizers' questions about sales, payouts and setup by pulling live data from PostgreSQL and the payments API.\n- **Portfolio Agent** (personal project): the agent on this site that answers visitors' questions about his experience and projects. It is also exposed as an MCP server. Source and eval report are on GitHub.\n\nFull CV and booking: https://alberto-cv.example.net/book",
